/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/12/006.md:9:> - 条件/判断类：循环迁移/cyclic_migration, 各角独立着色/per_corner_coloring, 整图半周旋转/half_turn_rotation, 邻域多数色/neighborhood_majority_color, 反色填充/opposite_color_fill, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 连接跨越/connection_span, 中点居中放置/center_at_midpoint, 遮挡由镜像恢复/occluded_recovered_by_mirror, 有空洞则重涂/recolor_if_hole, 配对色映射/paired_color_mapping, 控制极值定矩形/ctrl_extremes_rect, 枢轴连四边/pivot_to_sides, 高度即排名索引/legend_height_as_rank_index, 最大外扩余内缩/max_grow_rest_shrink, 角落象限提取/corner_quadrant_extraction, 单像素分量重涂/single_pixel_component_recolored, 最多标记面板输出/max_marker_panel, 缺失像素补新色/missing_new_color, 相邻标记间填充/fill_between_markers, 最小色为画笔/smallest_as_paint, 交替着色/alternating_coloring, 超界裁剪/clip_beyond_edge
